<title>NETHERLANDS: Sarakreek to buy Eastern Realty.</title>
<headline>Sarakreek to buy Eastern Realty.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property company Sarakreek said on Friday it had reached agreement to buy Eastern Realty Investment Corp of the U.S. for more than $185 million.</p>
</text>
